    {
      "id": "2108609316286529861",
      "author": "elonmusk",
      "author_name": "Elon Musk",
      "author_avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2053244804520427520/m8mdWZCG_200x200.jpg",
      "author_verified": true,
      "author_verified_type": "individual",
      "created_at_utc": "2026-10-09T17:23:31.000Z",
      "created_at_shanghai": "2026-10-10 01:23:31",
      "type": "转发",
      "type_label": "转发",
      "text": "BREAKING: Elon Musk takes aim at Mukesh Ambani, calling him “Prime Minister Ambani” and asking him to let Starlink compete in India. \n\nStarlink could help children access education, connect small businesses to global markets and save lives when disasters knock out other networks.\n\nElon is right to speak up. He has helped build technology that could change lives in communities still waiting for reliable internet. His argument deserves support: more opportunity for children, more customers for businesses and a lifeline for families during emergencies.\n\nIndia should welcome that ambition. Let Starlink compete, give Indians more choice and let consumers decide.",
      "quote": {
        "author": "elonmusk",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2103567689515954176/aR-Kjpp4_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-10-10 01:03:18",
        "created_at_utc": "2026-10-09T17:03:18.000Z",
        "id": "2108604227643719745",
        "images": [],
        "media": [],
        "name": "Elon Musk",
        "text": "Dear Prime Minister Ambani,\n\nPlease accept my humble apologies for not realizing that you are the real boss of India. \n\nNaturally, you would prefer to maintain your monopolistic exploitation of the great people of India, but would you nonetheless consider allowing Starlink to compete? \n\nThere are many areas of India, as there are in all countries, with no Internet access, which denies children the opportunity for education and for small businesses the opportunity to sell their goods to a global market. Starlink would change their lives for the better. \n\nThank you 🙏",
        "url": "https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2108604227643719745",
        "verified": true,
        "verified_type": "individual"
      },
      "retweet": {
        "author": "cb_doge",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1498070100393754625/C2V-fbll_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-10-10 01:17:34",
        "created_at_utc": "2026-10-09T17:17:34.000Z",
        "id": "2108607817150304536",
        "images": [
          "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUNHoRcawAACQbd.jpg?name=small"
