        "media": [
          {
            "height": 1125,
            "type": "photo",
            "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUNHoRcawAACQbd.jpg?name=small",
            "width": 1125
          }
        ],
        "name": "DogeDesigner",
        "text": "BREAKING: Elon Musk takes aim at Mukesh Ambani, calling him “Prime Minister Ambani” and asking him to let Starlink compete in India. \n\nStarlink could help children access education, connect small businesses to global markets and save lives when disasters knock out other networks.\n\nElon is right to speak up. He has helped build technology that could change lives in communities still waiting for reliable internet. His argument deserves support: more opportunity for children, more customers for businesses and a lifeline for families during emergencies.\n\nIndia should welcome that ambition. Let Starlink compete, give Indians more choice and let consumers decide.",
        "url": "https://x.com/cb_doge/status/2108607817150304536",
        "verified": true,
        "verified_type": "individual"
      },
